  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "27",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "27",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Selofehadi garmoó Heferi, garmoó Gileadi, garmoó Makiri, garmoó Manase, garmoó Yosefu i dasuú kón. Umer'ín a tí: Mala nee Noa, nee Hogla, nee Milka nee Tirsa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy dasuuwí tsiyahhaawo tana daqáy amór Mose, tari sihhiít dír geeraá Mose, nee dír geeraá kaahamusmoó Mungú Eleasari, nee dír geeraá geeraharuuse, nee dír geeraá dinku'uumár Israeli sleémeero, didár geeraá heémár Mungú, tari oó', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Baabuúrén ina gwaá' baraá xaanxaay, inós na/oó garma gu konká. Inós i kaahh baraá mukdá' Kora gwaa eehari, kudá' aa burumburiit daanduú AAKOÓ MUNGUHE, inós ina gwaá' as tlakweemaawós kilós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma milá umuú baabuúrén musku fiits baraá tlahhaywose, as adoodá' na/oó garma nguwa konkáhe? Aalirén haniisang dír tla/ángw hha'aá baabuúrén wa ale.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Mose kangw'ín kwí guri huúw dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ iri axweés dír Mose guri báy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Axweesantá dasuú doó Selofehadi i qoón, aalir'ín didár hha'aá baabuúín tiwa qasis, aalír baabuúín haniiseek ngi slaye'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daqaní xoorór Israeli ka beer, hee bira gwaá' naxes na/oó garma gu konká, aalirós ka haniisi dír dasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barnaxes na/oó dasi gu konká, aalirí ka haniisi dír hhaeewós awa daaqaay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee bar hha'aá daaqaay i kahhiyá', daqaní hha'aá baabá kin aalirí haniis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barnaxes baabuúwós hhiyoó hhawaata gu konká, daqaní aalirós ka haniisi dír heé guruú dó' i tseéw. Kaangwí an kaahi, nee an dawa dír xoorór Israeliro ar adoodá' anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngira hara'ayiím.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose guri báy, «Tsa/ám gawaá dindirmoó tlom'aá ta bay Abarimu, yaamuudá' naa dír xoorór Israelírí haniís xuuxuueek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamuká' bira aán kuúng tari kahhút, adoodá' hhiyaawók Aroni ira kahhuút. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma kuungá' axweesante'eé' ana sié' baraá xaanxayduú Siniro. Qoomár dinku'uuma sleémeero ar Israeli iwa qununú/ daanduueene, kuungá' hhohhoaarir'eé' aga laqaandi'iiká dír ilaá múk Israeliro, dír ma'aydae.» (Ma'ayká' a kudaá baraá Meribár baraá Kadeshi, tidár baraá xaanxoó Sini).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose AAKOÓ MUNGÚ guri firín iwa kaahi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Aá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, kuúng an iimu/úngw slafíngw umuúqo gár slafa. Aníng kuúng u firiím, hee qaaseek oo dinku'uumarók tí ga sagesihhmiít. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós inooín gi geeraharahaar bar ta iwiiwiit nee bar ta hi'iimiit. Bar ta slaqwarár áy inós ta geeraharumooín, as kahhó' mukók miwa adór bee/ángw de'eemusmo wásl tleehhiít.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose guri báy, «Yoshua garmoó Nuni taataahheek, inós i qeeruú kón baraawose, daqaní ku dákwí qás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee ku húp dír geeraá kaahamusmoó Mungú Eleasari, nee dír geeraá dinku'uuma sleémeero ar Israeli, daqaní kaangwí ku dirós i saayiín, dír geeraaín wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng inós ku ilaiwá/ dír geeraá múk wa alé, as kahhó' muu inós nguwa ilawawa/i, adoodá' kuúng tura ilaiwaá/, masók múk Israeli sleémeero inós ku iialooeemiis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua, kaahamusmoó Mungú Eleasari guri yaahamiis sla'aarir'eene. Asma Eleasari sla'aarir'eé' ga tsaahh ar loohír tlaa/anoodá' ta bay Urimu. Ar loohír /aymuú Eleasari i slaya, Yoshua nee múk Israeli sleémeero ngin geeraharahaar qoomár bar ta darah, laqaá bar ta ti'imiit.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa hara'ayín gari tleéhh. Yoshua guri taataáhh guri sihhtiís dír geeraá kaahamusmoó Mungú Eleasari, dír geeraá dinku'uuma sleémeero ar Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dabaawós giri qaás gawaá ságw Yoshua nee guri ilaiwawaá/ adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngura ádbáy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
